        "@value": "John Hewitt is a touring and songwriting troubadour performing over 150 shows per year and reimagining the solo world of folk and Americana inspired by greats like John Prine, Bob Dylan, Neil Young and Tom Petty."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
