        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Baby Tyler Show- for ages 6-106  | Gabriola Theatre Cen"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“Hansen turns anything and everything into a puppet and makes it funny.”  Watch as Ingrid Hansen performs a live puppet film before your very eyes, using only household objects, a camera, and her bare hands.  \nThank you to the Port Theatre for Sponsorship of Epidermis Circus and The Baby Tyler Show"
